null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_05_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_05_53","text":"but I must tell you something.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_05_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_05_54","text":"It is dangerous for a doctor and their patients to be too close to each other.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_05_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_05_55","text":"When someone close to the doctor is injured or dying, their emotions may affect their ability to respond properly to the situation at hand.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_05_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_05_56","text":"That's how this rule came about: when someone from a doctor's family is injured, they need to be taken care of by other doctors.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_05_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_05_57","text":"So I'm scared.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_05_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_05_58","text":"I'm scared that you're becoming special to